{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:13.10.470","page_type":"section"},"citation":"13.10.470","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.470","content_hash":"598fd02a4957f28934ca0cdbae85aac235a5cfcc186a2afea1ee9158248ce596","heading":"Illegal use of a fire hydrant.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.470:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.470","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to use a fire hydrant without a City-approved hydrant meter; provided, however, this subsection shall not apply to authorized City employees’ use of a fire hydrant.\n(b) It shall be unlawful for any person, other than authorized City Fire Department employees, to use any fire hydrant identified as a “firefighting use only” hydrant.\n(c) Penalty. Any person violating this section may be punished by:\n(1) Fine of not more than $499.00; and/or\n(2) Imprisonment in jail for not more than 179 days. (Ord. 18650 § 9, 6-6-06; Ord. 17246 § 4, 3-17-98. Code 1995 § 146-123.)\nCross References: Fire Department, TMC 2.20.030 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"1a63b30e-30a4-5096-a002-e2ad6e79f50f"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.10.470","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.470","content_hash":"9aeeba37eb649a6e5add576fef2f9c675da553931a2b0bcc02636d27adb0f7e2","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.470:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.470:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.10.470","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to use a fire hydrant without a City-approved 